ePiX -- TODO

July 28, 2002

The features listed here are vague plans for the future of ePiX; there
is no time-table for implementing these changes, nor any guarantee the
changes will ever occur. Please feel free to contact the author if you
have a feature you would like added.

* Better index for tutorial (user feedback is very important)

* Format line breaks in output by number of characters printed, rather
 than by the number of points printed
* Phase out pairs as predominant internal data structure, replacing them 
 with triples (x,y,0).

* General polylines and splines
* Error bar plotting, histograms
* Clipped plotting for ODEs
* Log scales for plotting

* Convex polyhedra with hidden line removal
* Axes for 3-D plotting
* Non-orthogonal projection functions
